Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the end of the line for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at your Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just not himself anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He transformed my only\Nmonster into a cocoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be planning to hatch\Nanother insect monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I play polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing me to fuse my knight and my\Ndragon to form Gaia, the Dragon Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gaia, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You just triggered my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,DNA Surgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I needed to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me change every monster\Non the field into an insect,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Including your dragon champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you know, my insect\Nbarrier blocks all insect attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil has me trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every monster I summon becomes a bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as this insect barrier is in\Nplay, none of my attacks will get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat this guy once\Nand you can do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, you got three Toons\Nbreathing down your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You better think of something\Nbefore you're extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in way over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the seal of\NAurichalcos, I can never be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On with the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Polymerization to combine my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:03:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilosaurus with my Kytoptera\Nto form Pornsaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you ain't seen nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play Giant Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And a Seal of Orichalcos gives\Nmy Jurassic Giants a power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.93,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get prehistoric on you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By letting my ravenous\Nmeat-eaters chow down on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points. My\NHorn-Saurus is up first now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,attack Wheeler directly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he do that when you've\Ngot a monster on the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Horn-Saurus has a special\Nability That lets him bypass
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,your monsters and go straight\Nfor your life points Tough break
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That runt is kicking your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:04:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For my next trick, Giant Rex will\Nmake your panther warrior disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your last monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cheerleading skills need work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I interrupt you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's only fair to let my\Ngilosaurus have his shot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Skategold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always hated those hairballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And they've always hated you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, warn me when\Nyou're gonna save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, back to the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card cell\Ndivision, and I'll use it on my Legul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my cell division card, I\Nhave two leeches for the price of one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you actually thought I'd be frightened
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,by a monster with a\Nmere 800 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you're sadly mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you, of all people,\Nwould recognize a good strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.95,0:05:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess what I heard\Nabout you is true, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Yugi's help, you're\Nnothing but a second-rate wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I win this duel, you'll be\Nlocked away forever with your better half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't stand a\Nchance, you little cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The roach is one of the\Nstrongest insects alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you're so tough,\Nthen show us what you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:05:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop talking about it! Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my pheromone wasp and my\Nleghole in order to summon my insect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for her crown,\Nthe mark of the Oritaltos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget about her\Nhighness's special ability. She receives
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,a whopping 200 extra attack points\Nfor every insect monster on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's 400 for my two insects\NPlus another 400 for the two
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,insects on your side of the field\NFor a grand total of 3,500 points
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's the strongest creature in\Nplay. Yes, but before it attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Legal, suck him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It jumps over your defense\Nand strikes you directly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:07:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's served its purpose, I'll\Nsacrifice my Legul so my queen can attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Insect Queen, attack\Nhis dragon champion
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your monster's gone, my\Nqueen loses some attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gained something even more precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My prehistoric pets are\Ngonna walk all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, Geekasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got more talent in my left\Nnostril than you'll ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Aurichalcos is on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,so I've got more power\Nthan you and your nostrils.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now clear something up for me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this duel really worth\Nthat much to you, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're risking your own\Nsoul just for a chance to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.45,0:08:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm earning the respect\NI deserve, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because ever since you knocked me out\Nof the Duelist Kingdom tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been mocked,\Nridiculed, and humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all gonna end here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sick and tired of being a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That speech sounds kind of familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the Mai you knew is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I traded in her soul for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The old Mai was too lonely and pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl was just holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This darts guy must prey on people's\Nweaknesses by promising them power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never stop this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Horn-Saurus, attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You just triggered my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate magic arm shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes again, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a trap, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Jurassic Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It cancels out any trap\Nused against a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So your monster's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Rex, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Trample his puny scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gilosaurus, it's time\Nto see what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're one attack away\Nfrom losing your soul forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my Red-Eyes Black Dragon, the card\NI won from Rex back in Dula's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my last scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I activate Star Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is add\None to the number I roll,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can summon a monster\Nwith that many stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it and wait, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, six plus one was seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So here comes a seven-star monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take more than\Ndumb luck to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a point there, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe this can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look familiar, Dino Brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's back. Better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm enhancing his\Npower with my Metal Morph card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now old Red-Eyes gets a 300-point boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, whenever he attacks a monster,\Nhe absorbs half its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the fun part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me simplify this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When my dragon blows your old\Nfossil back to the Stone Age,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,his power grows by half of 2,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away, red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back into extinction for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My insect army is slowly\Ninfesting the playing field
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few more turns and you're\Nbug bait. We'll see. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,People like you never win. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More comments from the peanut gallery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what is a person like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a greedy, power-hungry worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that make you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong, but aren't\Nyou the one who wanted power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So much that you sold out your\Nbest friend just for a taste of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it, bug boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you what I witnessed\Nfirsthand during your last duel, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were determined to win\Nat all costs, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you activated the seal of Oricalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you knew you were endangering\Nthe life of someone close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call\Npower hungry and greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this time the seal and\Nall of its powers belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not scaring anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can win this duel\Nby playing your little head games,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're sorely mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too smart for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What you refer to as head games, I\Ncall opening you up to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And whether you realize it or not,\Nit's causing you to doubt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be shaking in fear also.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were the one about\Nto lose his soul, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Red Eyes is here,\Nyou're an endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing you, Raptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve\Nusing that against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon was my best card\Nuntil you took it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I won that card fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fossilize his dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes, you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be a regional\Nduel monsters champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time, Weevil and I were the most\Nfamous duelists in the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't walk one block\Nwithout being recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, does anyone have a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're walking\Ndown the street like regular guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think they'd\Nhave a limo or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, everyone in the world will envy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back on top, just like I was\Nbefore you defeated me in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be Weevil Underwood,\Nthe new king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a nice ring, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot what it feels\Nlike to be worshipped and adored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have your autographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you do the honors, Rex. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot. You guys rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not giving these\Nthings away for free, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cost you your rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My card?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, my fame didn't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I became a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to win the most prestigious\Ndueling tournament ever thrown,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and instead I was defeated by a rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I went in as a champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but I came out as the laughingstock\Nof the entire dueling world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was knocked out of the\Ntournament in round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bug Boy and Dino Dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe those two are actually\Nshowing their faces in public?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Some fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The second we lost, they all disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost everything to\Na couple of newcomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No more movie premieres.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No more private parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you Rex and Weevil? Who's asking? Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the card they took from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the one. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do with\Nthose autographs anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I couldn't even\Nget those things away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the lowest point of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, it's been one\Nbad day after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a household name,\Nand now I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I owe it all to you, Joey Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you finished yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hearing your sob story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to feel bad for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you think that it's my\Nfault you're not popular anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a life, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the point! What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That you don't have a life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my life away from\Nme, and now I want it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no one to\Nblame but yourself, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see you're dueling\Nfor the wrong reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, this game is about\Nstriving to be my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's taught me to trust myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And to keep trying, no\Nmatter how tough things get.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, things have\Ngotten pretty tough out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I never gave up, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't handle the fact that Duel Monsters\Nisn't all about fame and fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Annoyed because you\Nhad the game all wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're even lamer than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you give the term goody-two-shoes\Nan entirely new meaning, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized a long time ago that being Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice Guy gets you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to team\Nup with Darts and his gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave me something I could\Nnever get just by playing fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The power I need to finally win back\Neverything that you took away from me, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you'll never learn, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just move on, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's party time! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Gilosaurus and Giant\NRex, so I can summon Tyrant Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the Seal of Aurichalcos,\Nit gets an extra 500 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have Giant Dragons now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But only one's gonna remain standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel like your life is\Nspinning out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe that's because it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.53,0:18:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, a friendly reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Two turns have passed since\Nmy cocoon first appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now before it hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it does, you'll meet the\Nsame fate as your little buddy, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never meant for this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Karibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That means my insect queen\Ngains 200 more points!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, my DNA trap card\Nturns all your monsters to bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Be patient, Great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the soul of the\Npharaoh shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to pay the ultimate price,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll be known as the duelist\Nwho dethroned the king of games!
